@startuml
title Activity Tambah Pesanan - Aqiqah System

|Admin|
start
:Membuka menu Pesanan;
:Mengklik tombol Tambah;

|Sistem|
:GET /admin/orders/create;
:Mengambil data pendukung;

|Database|
:SELECT FROM customers;
:SELECT FROM packages;
:SELECT FROM bone_menus;
:SELECT FROM meat_menus;

|Sistem|
:Mengirim data ke form;
|Admin|
:Melihat form create dengan
dropdown customers, packages, menus;
if (Jenis pelanggan?) then (Existing)
  :Memilih customer dari dropdown;
